    "paths": {
        "/trader-endpoint-sample/webhook-receiver": {
            "post": {
                "tags": [
                    "Webhooks Integration"
                ],
                "summary": "Sample Trader Webhook Receiver Endpoint",
                "description": "This is a mock / documentation endpoint demonstrating how you (the Trader) should configure, receive, and verify incoming webhook requests dispatched by Zhikgold.\n\n---\n\n### Delivery Conditions & Network Behavior\n- **Trigger:** Webhooks are triggered automatically immediately after new metal prices are committed to the database.\n- **Requirements:**\n  1. Your trader account status must be active (`is_active = true`).\n  2. Webhook integration must be enabled (`webhook_enabled = true`).\n  3. A valid HTTPS endpoint (`webhook_url`) and `webhook_secret` must be configured.\n- **Timeouts:**\n  - Connection timeout: **1 second**\n  - Total request timeout: **3 seconds**\n- **Retry Mechanism:**\n  - In case of network failure or HTTP `5xx`/`4xx` responses, the system retries **2 times** (total 3 attempts).\n  - Backoff delay between attempts: **2 seconds**.\n\n---\n\n### Webhook Security & Verification Guide\nTo protect your endpoints against **Spoofing**, **Data Tampering**, and **Replay Attacks**, Zhikgold signs every request cryptographically using HMAC-SHA256 with your private `webhook_secret`.\n\n```text\n1. Signature Construction\n    payload_to_sign = \"{timestamp}.{event_id}.{raw_request_body}\"\n    computed_hash   = hash_hmac(\"sha256\", payload_to_sign, webhook_secret)\n    expected_header = \"v1=\" + computed_hash\n2. Verification Steps\n    Check Required Headers: Extract X-Webhook-Timestamp, X-Webhook-Id, and X-Webhook-Signature.\n    Prevent Replay Attacks: Ensure abs(current_timestamp - X-Webhook-Timestamp) <= 300 (reject requests older than 5 minutes).\n    Verify Signature: Compute the HMAC hash using the raw unparsed HTTP body ($request->getContent()) and compare it using timing-safe comparison (hash_equals).\n    Enforce Idempotency: Track X-Webhook-Id (e.g., in Redis / Cache) to skip already-processed duplicate dispatches.\n    Return HTTP 200: Respond with HTTP status 200 OK promptly to prevent timeouts.\n    Implementation Example (PHP / Laravel)\n\n<?php\npublic function handleWebhook(\\Illuminate\\Http\\Request $request)\n{\n    $secret    = config('services.zhikgold.webhook_secret');\n    $timestamp = $request->header('X-Webhook-Timestamp');\n    $eventId   = $request->header('X-Webhook-Id');\n    $signature = $request->header('X-Webhook-Signature');\n\n    // 1. Validate security headers presence\n    if (! $timestamp || ! $eventId || ! $signature) {\n        return response()->json(['message' => 'Missing signature headers.'], 401);\n    }\n\n    // 2. Reject replay attacks (tolerance: 5 minutes)\n    if (abs(time() - (int) $timestamp) > 300) {\n        return response()->json(['message' => 'Expired webhook timestamp.'], 401);\n    }\n\n    // 3. Compute expected signature using RAW body\n    $rawBody = $request->getContent();\n\n    $expectedSignature = str_replace('v1=', '', $signature);\n\n    $computedSignature = hash_hmac(\n        'sha256',\n        \"{$timestamp}.{$eventId}.{$rawBody}\",\n        $secret\n    );\n\n    if (! hash_equals($computedSignature, $expectedSignature)) {\n        return response()->json(['message' => 'Invalid webhook signature.'], 401);\n    }\n\n    // 4. Enforce idempotency (deduplication)\n    $cacheKey = \"webhook_event:{$eventId}\";\n    if (! \\Illuminate\\Support\\Facades\\Cache::add($cacheKey, true, now()->addDay())) {\n        return response()->json(['message' => 'Duplicate event ignored.'], 200);\n    }\n\n    // 5. Process metal price payload\n    $payload = $request->json()->all();\n    // Your business logic here ...\n\n    return response()->json(['status' => 'success'], 200);\n}",
                "operationId": "c5c7ad678f2d0ee67209594af2a2b379",
                "parameters": [
                    {
                        "name": "X-Webhook-Signature",
                        "in": "header",
                        "description": "HMAC-SHA256 digital signature formatted as v1={hash}",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "example": "v1=8f7e8a9b0c7d6e5f4a3b2c1d0e9f8a7b6c5d4e3f2a1b0c9d8e7f6a5b4c3d2e1f"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "X-Webhook-Timestamp",
                        "in": "header",
                        "description": "UNIX timestamp (in seconds) when the webhook dispatch was initiated. Used for replay attack prevention.",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "example": 1787841000
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "X-Webhook-Id",
                        "in": "header",
                        "description": "Unique event identifier (ULID/UUID) for idempotency and duplicate delivery handling.",
                        "required": true,
                        "schema": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "example": "01HQXYZ123456789ABCDEF0000"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "requestBody": {
                    "description": "Real-time updated metal price payload dispatched to trader",
                    "required": true,
                    "content": {
                        "application/json": {
                            "schema": {
                                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MetalPriceWebhookPayload"
                            }
                        }
                    }
                },
                "responses": {
                    "200": {
                        "description": "Webhook successfully received, signature verified, and acknowledged by trader",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "status": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "success"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "401": {
                        "description": "Unauthorized: Missing headers, invalid HMAC-SHA256 signature, or expired timestamp (replay attempt)",
                        "content": {
                            "application/json": {
                                "schema": {
                                    "properties": {
                                        "message": {
                                            "type": "string",
                                            "example": "Invalid signature."
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "type": "object"
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "500": {
                        "description": "Internal Server Error on trader side: System will retry delivery based on retry policy."
                    }
                },
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "url": "https://api.zhikgold.ir",
                        "description": "Main API Server"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
